# Terraform working directories, state, and potentially sensitive plans/variables
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.dev-context
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Carelog TLS candidate tests: throwaway CA and key material must never be committed
candidates/carelog-tls/tests/.work/
candidates/carelog-tls/ca/*.key
candidates/carelog-tls/tests/**/*.key
candidates/carelog-tls/tests/**/*.pem
